    {
      "id": "sec_004",
      "type": "theoretical",
      "title": "EVS Class 1 - Lesson 8: Animal Life > Page-by-Page Content > Page 1",
      "content_text": "- **Text length:** 637 characters - **Word count:** 109 - **Text blocks:** 15 - **Images:** 3 - Image files: - `page_1_img_39.png` (xref: 39) - `page_1_img_45.png` (xref: 45) - `page_1_img_47.png` (xref: 47) **Text content:** ``` Animals are living beings like us which are found in nature. Animals are found all over the world and they need food, shelter, air, and water like other living beings, to grow and survive. Their size, eating habits, body colour, and body covering vary according to the place they are found in. All animals need care and protection. Highlights of the Lesson • Animals around us • Land Animals • Water Animals • Birds • Insects • Animal Homes We Learn • Do you have any pet animals? _____________________________ •How do you look after you pet animal? _____________________________ Lesson : 8 Animal Life 7 Rockland -EVS - Class 1 ``` **Image locations (from text blocks):** - `page_1_img_39.png` - `page_1_img_45.png` - `page_1_img_47.png`",
