      "content_text": "- **Text length:** 413 characters - **Word count:** 68 - **Text blocks:** 11 - **Images:** 6 - Image files: - `page_3_img_146.png` (xref: 146) - `page_3_img_148.png` (xref: 148) - `page_3_img_150.png` (xref: 150) - `page_3_img_152.png` (xref: 152) - `page_3_img_45.png` (xref: 45) - `page_3_img_47.png` (xref: 47) **Text content:** ``` Insects Very small animals are called “Insects”. They have six legs. Some insects have wings to fly. Butterfly Housefly Grasshopper Domestic Animals: Animals that are kept at home or around our homes are called “Domestic Animals”. They are useful to us. Pet Animals: Some animals like dog, parrot and rabbit are kept as pets. We love them and take care of them. 9 Rockland -EVS - Class 1 ``` **Image locations (from text blocks):** - `page_3_img_146.png` - `page_3_img_148.png` - `page_3_img_150.png` - `page_3_img_152.png` - `page_3_img_45.png` - `page_3_img_47.png`",
