      "type": "theoretical",
      "title": "Lesson : 8 Animal Life > Highlights of the Lesson > Let’s Recall",
      "content_text": "- Animals live both on land and in water. - Animals are of different sizes. - Animals that can fly are called birds. - Very small animals are called insects. - Animals that can be kept at home are domestic animals. - Animals that live in jungle are called wild animals. - Different animals live in different homes and eat different foods. PRINTFILE-pages-2_images/imageFile32.png>)",
